xserver-xorg-video-wmt (1.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Rebind the root pixmap each server generation.
  * Keep depth 32 pixmaps in software; the GE preserves destination alpha.
  * Honor GE wait failures and request the full kernel wait timeout.
  * Drain pending flips before modesets.
  * Resolve unnotified flips from the kernel CRTC state instead of waiting.
  * Fail screen init if EXA setup fails; map the framebuffer when unaccelerated.

